          "answer": "Let $u = 2^x$: $2u^2 - 9u + 4 = 0 \\Rightarrow (2u-1)(u-4) = 0 \\Rightarrow u = 1/2 \\Rightarrow x = -1$, or $u = 4 \\Rightarrow x = 2$."
